{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在人物动机的解释和段落之间的因果衔接上不如Y完整，尤其Y更清楚地交代了他为什么从害怕暴露喜欢，逐渐走向不再隐藏。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的主线短而醒目，重点词容易捕捉，小字感受又提供了丰富的身体、环境和音乐细节，部分感受还随音乐进程出现，比较适合一边听一边扫屏幕。Y的心理解释和前后因果确实更完整，但左侧长句需要连续阅读，容易让人把注意力从音乐转移到文字上。综合实际观看体验，我更愿意选X，它让情绪先被感受到，再被理解；不过人物心理转折的解释力度，Y更胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "89fa1d07-34bf-467e-8604-00fdcb43dfda", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T051808917050Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T05:19:31.593236+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b04833623c4a52a10a6c9bf856706ba87e39bd5f93cf99842a11cf69876cfef4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachment